<title>FRANCE: Promodes denies plans for con bond issue.</title>
<headline>Promodes denies plans for con bond issue.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>French hypermarkets group Promodes denied market rumours on Thursday that it was planning an issue of convertible bonds.</p>
<p>&quot;Promodes denies this rumour,&quot; a spokesman told Reuters.</p>
<p>The group has been the subject of many recent market rumours, notably speculation that it could merge with or acquire retailer Casino.</p>
<p>Its stock was down 0.19 percent at 2,096 francs at 1145 GMT, while the CAC-40 index was 1.89 percent higher.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom, +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
